      text: "In the classic polar transport pathway of a shoot, labelled auxin moves basipetally. Which direction does that describe?",
      options: [{ key: "a", text: "From the shoot base toward its apex." }, { key: "b", text: "From the stem center toward its surface." }, { key: "c", text: "From the shoot apex toward its base." }, { key: "d", text: "From mature leaves only into their veins." }],
      answer: "c",
